# Keep deploy uploads scoped to build-required inputs.
.vercel/
.env*.local
node_modules/
dist/
tmp/
scratch/
# Keep only root-level dump/export folders out of the upload; nested source
# directories like src/mazer-core/logging/export are required for the build.
/export/
/exports/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Local/editor state
.codex/
.playbook/
fawxzzy-mazer.code-workspace

# Non-build repo surfaces
artifacts/
# docs/ is excluded except docs/contracts/, which is a genuine build-time
# dependency: src/theme/tokens.ts, src/state/uiState.ts, and
# src/geometry/topologyPath.ts import their canonical *.v1.json contracts
# directly from docs/contracts/ (see docs/architecture/MAZER-UI-REWORK-
# DECISION-REGISTRY.md, "Registry shape" -- these are shared contracts, not
# documentation). A flat `docs/` exclusion plus a `!docs/contracts/`
# negation was tried first and confirmed NOT to work against a real
# `vercel deploy` (verified live: the negation is honored by git's own
# gitignore engine but Vercel's own upload-filter did not restore the
# negated files -- the deployed build still failed with the same TS2307
# errors and the uploaded file count did not change). To avoid relying on
# negation support at all, every current non-contracts entry under docs/ is
# excluded explicitly instead, leaving docs/contracts/ untouched by any
# pattern. If a new top-level entry is added directly under docs/ in the
# future that is not meant to ship, it must be added to this list --
# scripts/checks/verify-vercelignore-imports.mjs (runs automatically as
# part of `npm run build` via scripts/build/run-build.mjs; invoke directly
# with `node ./scripts/checks/verify-vercelignore-imports.mjs`) will NOT
# catch a newly-added stray docs/ file on its own; it only guards against
# runtime imports resolving to an excluded path. Not wired in as its own
# package.json script because package.json is a protected path
# (docs/contracts/mazer-ui-rework-decision-registry.v1.json
# prProtection.protectedPaths) owned by PR #83/#82's Wave 0B reconciliation,
# not this lane.
docs/architecture/
docs/architecture.md
docs/COMMANDS.md
docs/current-truth.md
docs/INTEGRATION_SCOPE.md
docs/legacy/
docs/MAZER_SUPABASE_STORAGE.md
docs/mobile-plan.md
docs/ops/
docs/PLAYBOOK_NOTES.md
docs/PLAYBOOK_VISUAL_EVIDENCE.md
docs/research/
docs/roadmap.md
docs/system-map.md
docs/templates/
legacy/
tests/
tools/
PLAYBOOK.md
README.md
